{"metadata":{"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"title":[{"Plain":"En-代数"},2],"slug":[{"Plain":"En-代数"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<p>$\\mathbb E_n$-代数是算畴 "},{"Local":{"url":"En-算畴","text":"$\\mathbb E_n$"}},{"Plain":" 上的"},{"Local":{"url":"算畴上的代数","text":"代数"}},{"Plain":", 一种直观是具有 $n$ 个相容的"},{"Local":{"url":"结合代数","text":"结合运算"}},{"Plain":"的代数.</p>\n<p>关于 $n=2$ 的特殊情形, 见 "},{"Local":{"url":"E2-代数","text":"$\\mathbb E_2$-代数"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p>对于一个 $1$-范畴中的"},{"Local":{"url":"结合代数","text":"结合代数"}},{"Plain":" (如幺半群), 它<strong>要么是</strong>交换的, <strong>要么不是</strong>交换的; 这是"},{"Local":{"url":"结构","text":"性质而非结构"}},{"Plain":". 而对于"},{"Local":{"url":"无穷范畴","text":"无穷范畴"}},{"Plain":"中的"},{"Local":{"url":"结合代数","text":"结合代数"}},{"Plain":", 有一列无穷多个概念, 称为 $\\mathbb E_n$-代数. 当 $n$ 越来越大时, $\\mathbb E_n$-代数接近于"},{"Local":{"url":"交换代数","text":"交换代数"}},{"Plain":", 又称 $\\mathbb E_\\infty$-代数.</p>\n<h2>性质</h2>\n<p>如下事实体现了 “$\\mathbb{E}_n$-代数是有 $n$ 个相容的"},{"Local":{"url":"结合代数","text":"结合运算"}},{"Plain":"的代数” 的直观. 对于"},{"Local":{"url":"对称幺半范畴","text":"对称幺半范畴"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathcal C$,\n$$\r\n\\mathsf{Alg}_{\\mathbb E_n}(\\mathcal C)\\simeq \\underbrace{\\mathsf{Alg}_{\\mathbb E_1}\\cdots \\mathsf{Alg}_{\\mathbb E_1}}_{\\text{$n$}}(\\mathcal C).\r\n$$</p>\n<h3>拓扑场论</h3>\n<p>每个 $\\mathbb E_n$-代数都作为 "},{"Local":{"url":"Morita范畴","text":"Morita 范畴"}},{"Plain":"的对象通过"},{"Local":{"url":"分解同调","text":"分解同调"}},{"Plain":"给出"},{"Local":{"url":"拓扑场论","text":"拓扑场论"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}